{"term":{"label":"義","occurrences":5,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"2B","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-ii","title":"公孫丑下","description":"孟子曰：「天時不如地利，地利不如人和。三里之城，七里之郭，環而攻之而不勝。夫環而攻之，必有得天時者矣；然而不勝者，是天時不如地利也。城非不高也，池非不深也，兵革非不堅利也，米粟非不多也；委而去之，是地利不如人和也。故曰：域民不以封疆之界，固國不以山谿之險，威天下不以兵革之利。得道者多助，失道者寡助。寡助之至，親戚畔之；"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"予","id":"予"},{"form":"人","id":"人"},{"form":"仁","id":"仁"},{"form":"何","id":"何"},{"form":"公","id":"公"},{"form":"反","id":"反"},{"form":"告","id":"吿"},{"form":"周","id":"周"},{"form":"宿","id":"宿"},{"form":"惡","id":"惡"},{"form":"王","id":"王"},{"form":"義","id":"義"},{"form":"自","id":"自"},{"form":"行","id":"行"},{"form":"言","id":"言"},{"form":"齊","id":"齊"}],"edges":[{"weight":2.0068708488450007,"source":"公","target":"仁"},{"weight":2.9231615807191558,"source":"公","target":"周"},{"weight":1.536867219599265,"source":"公","target":"自"},{"weight":0.525266307920785,"source":"公","target":"人"},{"weight":0.8437200390393197,"source":"公","target":"何"},{"weight":0.2823201293103955,"source":"齊","target":"人"},{"weight":0.7830954172228849,"source":"齊","target":"仁"},{"weight":0.3448404862917296,"source":"齊","target":"王"},{"weight":1.2939210409888755,"source":"齊","target":"義"},{"weight":0.6877852374185599,"source":"齊","target":"言"},{"weight":1.4762425977828302,"source":"齊","target":"反"},{"weight":1.0062389685370945,"source":"齊","target":"自"},{"weight":1.0062389685370945,"source":"齊","target":"宿"},{"weight":0.661398482245365,"source":"予","target":"行"},{"weight":1.4723286984616937,"source":"予","target":"何"},{"weight":0.05526267867504952,"source":"予","target":"言"},{"weight":0.8437200390393197,"source":"予","target":"惡"},{"weight":1.0668635903535293,"source":"予","target":"宿"},{"weight":0.8437200390393197,"source":"予","target":"反"},{"weight":0.11980119981262058,"source":"人","target":"仁"},{"weight":0.6306268235786113,"source":"人","target":"義"},{"weight":0.11980119981262058,"source":"人","target":"反"},{"weight":0.3429447511268